= Instructions

In a #Shot glass{}, pour in @Vanilla vodka{1 oz}, then @Pineapple juice{1 oz}, then @Grenadine syrup{splash}.

The grenadine syrup will quickly settle at the bottom of your shot.
You can pour it over a spoon to get an even cleaner gradient colour.

Slice a @Maraschino cherry{1} on the bottom to garnish the side of your shot glass with.